      "widgets_values": [
        "Live-action cinematic medium-wide continuous shot inside a quiet neighborhood bakery at dawn, lit by warm amber oven light and cool blue window light across worn wood counters and flour-dusted surfaces. A gray-haired man in a dark green apron slides a metal tray of bread toward the glowing oven while a small orange cat watches from a nearby stool. One loaf slowly swells into a comically perfect dome; the baker stops, narrows his eyes, leans closer, and steadies the tray with both hands. He tilts his head toward the loaf and says in a dry, quiet voice, “Well, you are ambitious.” The camera makes one restrained push toward the baker, ending in a medium close-up that keeps his puzzled face, the domed loaf, and the attentive cat clearly visible without a cut. Warm oven crackle, soft metal tray scrapes, faint cloth movement, distant morning birds, and clean synchronized speech occupy one continuous acoustic space; no music.",
